    "detailed_description": "**Early Access** <br>**[ENDLESS DAYS Z] - Ongoing Development and Future Updates**<br><br>**Main Description:**<br><br>&quot;Hello, Endlessdaysz players!<br><br>We would like to share an important update on the development status of our game. While Endless DaysZ has officially launched, I am committed to continually improving the game with new features, gameplay tweaks, performance improvements, and bug fixes, all based on the incredible feedback from the community.<br><br>- **New Features and Content**: I am planning to add new game modes, enemies, weapons, and more. Your feedback is crucial! We want to hear your ideas, suggestions, and concerns to make the game better.<br><br>&quot;Endless Days Z is a real-time, do-what-you-want game where you lead a group of survivors through a world ravaged by a deadly plague.  High-quality environments such as cities, forests and factories, dense vegetation, collect samples, destroy enemy bases and fight hordes of enemies while searching for a cure. Dystopian enemies, NPCs, looters, military and zombies.<br><br>Key features:<br><br>High-definition graphics: Immerse yourself in detailed environments with state-of-the-art visual effects.<br><br>Free play: Search enemy bases, destroy as many zombies as possible.<br><br>Environments: Explore vast environments.<br><br>Solo co-op: Face the threats of DeltaVirus-7 together.<br><br>Story: &quot;In a world where humanity is on the brink of extinction, a team of scientists races against time to find a cure for DeltaVirus-7. Face moral dilemmas, forge alliances and uncover the dark secrets that led to the devastation.&quot;<br><br>&quot;Get ready for the fight for survival!  Add Endless Days Z to your wishlist and be the first to face the apocalypse.&quot;",
